# Intentional hits for tools/check_public.py. One entry per line: <path glob> | <regex matched against the line>.
# Keep this list short and explain each entry.

# A software version number (Granny exporter SDK), not an IP address.
docs/hd-models.md | SDK version 2\.12\.0\.5
# Inventory software versions, not IP addresses.
docs/source-inventory.md | SGD2FreeRes.*3\.0\.3\.1
docs/source-inventory.md | PlugY 14\.0\.3\.0
docs/source-inventory.md | D2GL 1\.0\.4\.0
# The common-controls assembly version in the launcher manifest, not an IP address.
launcher/res/launcher.manifest | Microsoft\.Windows\.Common-Controls" version="6\.0\.0\.0"
# D2RLoader file versions (LoaderVersionMatches), not addresses
launcher/* | 1\.3\.1\.[02]
docs/launcher.md | `1\.3\.1\.0`
# binary art and fonts of the downloader (history scan with --text reads their bytes as lines)
launcher/res/*.gif | .
launcher/res/*.ttf | .
launcher/res/*.png | .
launcher/res/*.ico | .
# monster token 8@ (lane tokens): DCC file names, not addresses
docs/legacy-graphics.md | 8@[a-z0-9]+\.(dcc|cof)
